  "note": "Element-quarter correspondences vary between traditions. James follows Dee's original assignment. The Golden Dawn reversed South and North element attributions.",
  "fundamentalObeisance": "The Fundamental Obeisance is the conjuration for obtaining the benign ministry of the good angels. It invokes God as IEOVAH ZEBAOTH and names the twelve mystical Names: ORO, IBAH, AOZPI, MOR, DIAL, HCTGA, OIP, TEAA, PDOCE, MPH, ARSL, GAIOL.",
  "greatCircle": "The four triads are the Names of God extracted from the four lines of the holy spirit, which govern all creatures on the earth (both visible and invisible). They are carried upon twelve banners.",
